                Walk: "Walk animation, one static tripod shot: the camera never moves, zooms or pans, and the drone flies forward in place, as if held in a wind tunnel, keeping the same size, pose and place in frame. From the first frame to the last the glow under it brightens and thin pale cyan light trails stream back from it toward the upper left, flickering at an even pace; no ground contact. Seamless loop: the last frame matches the first.",
                Attack: "Attack animation, one static tripod shot: the camera never moves, zooms or pans, and the drone keeps its place in frame, hovering. A short bright cyan electric spark leaps from its crystal eye straight toward the lower right and out of the frame, then the spark fades and it hovers in its starting pose.",
                Cast: "Cast animation, one static tripod shot: the camera never moves, zooms or pans, and the drone keeps the same size, pose and place in frame. Its crystal eye holds a steady thin green extraction beam toward a point just outside the frame at the lower right, with small showering sparks, while its body and grippers hold still. Seamless loop: the last frame matches the first.",
            },
            "warp_strider": {
                Idle: "Idle animation, one static tripod shot: the camera never moves, zooms or pans, and the walker keeps the same size, pose and place in frame. It stands still, keeping its three-quarter view: it never turns toward the camera, sways or shifts, and its head never turns or nods; only its cyan eye and small violet lights glow steadily. Seamless loop: the last frame matches the first.",
                Walk: "Walk animation, one static tripod shot: the camera never moves, zooms or pans, and the walker never turns, leans or steps toward the camera. It strides briskly on the spot as if on a treadmill: its three long legs lift and step in turn at an even pace from the first frame to the last, while its body keeps the same place, size and three-quarter facing in frame. Nothing else appears in the frame. Seamless loop: the last frame matches the first.",
